  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h1> Installing a polygonal chuck with »tribos« </h1>",
   "body": "<p>With »the tribos 600,« you can mount and measure the length of SCHUNK’s TRIBOS-type polygonal shrink-fit chucks that are μm-accurate. The device positions the TRIBOS clamping unit and checks the TRIBOS pressure control system as well as the search run for aligning the SCHUNK clamping surfaces. </p> <p>All automatic. All precise. All perfectly checked.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/company/contact\">Request more information now</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/5/csm_tribos_detail_8ee52f9160.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
